# key: lms.help.credentials
#: admin/platforms.py
msgid ""
"Tokens and secrets the driver needs (see docs/lms-integration-guide.md). "
"Stored encrypted; leave empty on edit to keep the stored ones."
msgstr ""
"ໂທເຄັນ ແລະ ລະຫັດລັບທີ່ໄດຣເວີຕ້ອງການ (ເບິ່ງ docs/lms-integration-guide.md). "
"ເກັບແບບເຂົ້າລະຫັດ; ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງເມື່ອແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອຮັກສາຄ່າທີ່ເກັບໄວ້."

#: admin/platforms.py
msgid "One key=value per line, e.g. token=..."
msgstr "ແຖວລະໜຶ່ງ key=value, ເຊັ່ນ token=..."

# key: lms.help.is_active
#: admin/platforms.py
msgid ""
"Active platforms receive published sections and roster changes as they "
"happen, and the nightly reconcile."
msgstr ""
"ແພລດຟອມທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ຈະໄດ້ຮັບກຸ່ມຮຽນທີ່ເຜີຍແຜ່ ແລະ ການປ່ຽນແປງລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຮຽນທັນທີ, "
"ພ້ອມທັງການກວດທຽບປະຈຳຄືນ."

# key: lms.help.should_pull_grades
#: admin/platforms.py
msgid ""
"Lets instructors load the platform's final scores into the grade entry "
